          ],
          "content": "？ **Can you explain why this is happening using the Token Model of integers that we saw in the Class 6 textbook of mathematics? Ans:** Yes."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.2,
            0.349,
            0.605,
            0.367
          ],
          "content": "Consider the expression: − 6 + (− 7) + (– 13)"
